    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew sis. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew diktam ea damwanagi aba Yerusalemu, ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yedida was hudeaba Adaya bea mujiineeda Boskati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghwaat geeshta Dawdi was ghoan, nea miighwasajaada gagal geatinda dugwa ghana geatinda ghaadaam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geanyas Gitaabooda deaweeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damasis bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yosiya, hean goojeakta sugoocheanda Shafani orjeeda Asaliya orjeeda Meshulamu was ng'oorshoocheanda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Una heeda Hilkiya, was ashoohoocheanda haw, ak gwayiida lapiyeeda sean siyeada gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ghayi ang'waay furiischoodiga gidaghuuta aba heeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayiin lapiyeedida geatinga fuga miineadaysa fuga gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geataw fuga gadiiyi aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak gajeadeasa heeda nyaraat aba jeeda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geataw fuga beara beehajeega, ea fuga deekshachi, ak gaweay ghwasha geediga, ea lagheanga sishit jea eesina gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fugiga siitaw lapiyeedida ea meanyaasha iita gidagadiyeata lapiyeedida, aba gideaba gwasinda gadiyeeda gidamiisa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda haw ak gwayeesha Shafani was ng'oorshoocheanda, “Naanyaschi gitaabooda deaweeda aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA.” Hean ghoadaw Hilkiya Shafani gitaaboadida ak ghoasoamwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa Shafani was ng'oorshoocheanda heeda sugoocheanda, ak ghoadaw gicha sugoocheanda iita nea gwayeesha, “Fugaagu bea gadiyeeda nigeanda lapiyeedida sinyasa jeeda gheedean ak ghwayiin geatinga fuga gadiyeeda, miineadaysa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha gicha Shafani was ng'oorshoocheanda sugoocheanda, “Nigoonan Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda gitaabu.” Ak ghoasoamwa Shafani aba madeeda sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy sugoocheanda ng'asheega gitaabooda deaweeda, hean ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukusa sugoocheanda geaba Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda haw, ea Ahikamu was orjeeda Shafani ea Akbori, orjeeda Mikaya, ea Shafani was ng'oorshoocheanda ea Asaya was siida gadiyeeda sugoocheanda nea gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aweayeena oanyaasha NG'UTAMIIDA aba badaydeanyu ea badaydeaba fiisu ea badayda Yuda sean, aba badayda ng'asheegeaba gitaaboani sinyasiin. Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ninyareas muuchi aba badaydeanyu, aba gideaba ghweanigaasa miighoang'waay ng'asheegeaba gitaaboani, ak gwasin suh seaniin ing'oorneasean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay geaba Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda ea Ahikamu, ea Akbori, ea Shafani, ea Asaya, heeda Hulda gatmooda was sibaneeda was gatmooda Shalumu, orjeeda Dikfa, orjeeda Harhasi was siida adiiwi hang'weaka sugoocheanda (abeeda niny goobiita Yerusalemu, bea meatkweedeaba iyeenya bea mujiini) ak geepalool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha saawa, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, ‘Ayeeshiina siidida ajeakneegwa heedeanyuun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Ng'ula, gaydeadu ng'asheanda muy hiji, ea badaydeaba fiisu mida hijiin aba huumwa ng'asheega sean bea gitaabooda asoamwa sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ninung'wanaan heeda ak ghoadaw aseecheeka suuk haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. Ak ghoanyareasan aba gadiyooji sean sin aba geatinga nyaawa, ak gaydanyareas muuchi aba hiji nea maygoosha nyarasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheandida bea Yuda ajeakneegwa oanyaasha NG'UTAMIIDEAN gajarukusiina gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli; aba badaydeaba ng'asheegiga iyiinyiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghang'arng'ariit gurooroadaang'u nea giyaadigeaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, damanda iiyiinyi ng'asheega eargu aba badaydeaba hiji ea badayda fuga mida hiji, bea gideaba gayghwaak salgheang'da nea geamwaashta, ak gibwaashaadi hang'weakaagu, nea giiyeawdi aba madeedeanyu, asi nealeeyseey iit gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula gaymeawa nea gibea hoyyoo, ak geebuyseey heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaagu, nea gheanyangaagu ea mayghwadaah ng'asheanda muy sean jea deadu hiji.’” Hean geeyeassa sugoocheanda iidi gicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
